Katharina,

please make sure you have re-installed *all* packages after upgrading to R 2.12. The packages are *not* compatible across R versions. I have tested JGR on Ubuntu 10.10 (I don't have any Mint Lucid around) and it works without problems.
If you still run into problems after upgrading properly, please supply all details - i.e. how did you install R, JGR and the packages (manually or using apt - if so from where...) and which Java are you using (I was using (IcedTea6 1.9.2) (6b20-1.9.2-0ubuntu1) successfully).

Cheers,
Simon


