Yep, that's very understandable - jgr-x64.exe works only with R <= 2.11.x. You'll have to use 
http://www.rforge.net/JGR/web-files/jgr-1_62-x64.exe
with R 2.12.0 and higher. Also make sure you update to rJava 0.8-8 from RForge.net (install.packages("rJava",,"http://rforge.net"))

